<title>INDIA: India's Reliance down 2.8 pct on BSE.</title>
<headline>India's Reliance down 2.8 pct on BSE.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of leading private firm Reliance Industries fell eight rupees, or 2.79 percent, to 279.25 rupees on Tuesday in afternoon trade on the Bombay bourse, traders said.</p>
<p>They said a foreign brokerage was selling the shares on behalf of a couple of foreign funds.</p>
<p>&quot;Funds who picked up the stock at around 220 rupees are just booking profits,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
